---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site, telHref } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title={`Text Messaging Terms of Service: ${site.name}`} description={`SMS terms of service for text messages from ${site.name} (${site.legalName}).`}>
  <main>
    <h1>Text Messaging Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="sub">{site.name} ({site.legalName}). Effective {site.effectiveDate}. See also our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h3>Program description</h3>
    <p>{site.name}, the business name of {site.legalName} ({site.location}), uses text messaging to communicate with its clients about {site.sms.messageTypes}. These are one-to-one conversational customer care messages, not marketing or promotional messages. Affiliate marketing is not part of this program, and we do not collect or sell consumer information for leads.</p>

    <h3>How you opt in</h3>
    <p>{site.sms.optInHow}</p>
    <p>You can read and print our <a href="/sms-consent-form">text message consent form</a>.</p>
    <p>After you opt in, you receive this confirmation: <em>"{site.sms.optInMessage}"</em></p>

    <h3>Message and data rates</h3>
    <p>Standard message and data rates may apply, depending on your mobile carrier and plan.</p>

    <h3>Message frequency</h3>
    <p>Message frequency varies based on your conversation with the office.</p>

    <h3>How to opt out</h3>
    <p>You may opt out of receiving text messages at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any message you receive from us. After you opt out, you will receive a confirmation message and we will stop sending text messages to your number. Reply <strong>START</strong> to begin receiving messages again.</p>

    <h3>How to get help</h3>
    <p>If you need assistance or have questions about our text messaging, reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message, or contact {site.name} at <a href={telHref}>{site.phone}</a>.</p>

    <h3>Privacy</h3>
    <p>Your phone number is handled in accordance with our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. We do not sell or share your phone number with third parties except as required by law or as needed to deliver your messages through our phone system and carrier.</p>

    <h3>Carriers</h3>
    <p>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>

    <h3>Changes to these terms</h3>
    <p>We may update these terms. The effective date at the top of this page will change when we do.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
